        DialogData: {
            Type: "BASIC",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Accept the charm — no arguing with an auntie",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    ConditionDataSet: {
                                        ConditionDataSet: [
                                            {
                                                Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                                Operation: "EQUALS",
                                                Name: "no_gift_bramblea_dusk_charm_claimed"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    Cmd: "loot give @s loot cobblemon_initiative:npc_gift/common"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    ConditionDataSet: {
                                        ConditionDataSet: [
                                            {
                                                Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                                Operation: "EQUALS",
                                                Name: "no_gift_bramblea_dusk_charm_claimed"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add gift_bramblea_dusk_charm_claimed"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "charm_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Keep your knees dry",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Take a charm before you go — no, take it, it is bad luck to refuse one at dusk. Willow-twist and a togepi feather. Keeps the mist honest, mostly. My mother swore by it and my mother drowned a very respectable old age."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You heard the Company man up the bank yet? Selling us coin. Coin! In a marsh! We told him the pale lights past the third willow would show him the way to riches, and off he trotted. There is nothing past the third willow but a very deep hole. Ha."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Rain by moonrise, mark me. My knees know it and my knees have never once been wrong about weather or in-laws."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "They say Titania trains blindfolded, so her own charm cannot catch her eyes. I had it from Maren, who had it from the reeds, so it is as good as sworn."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Yes, dear, the wings. Sharp eyes. A glamour slips at my age the way a shawl slips — you tug it back up and carry on with the kettle. The fair folk always did like a good boardwalk, and SOMEBODY respectable has to mind the gossip. If anyone asks, I am a nice old lady with charms. Which is also true. Everything about me is true, that is the trick of it."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Bramblea Mossglen",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
